<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1071753629"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:42.000"><div begin="25.019" end="48.852" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="25.019" end="30.240" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.019" end="25.411">我</span><span begin="25.411" end="26.030">突</span><span begin="26.030" end="26.328">然</span><span begin="26.328" end="27.179">觉</span><span begin="27.179" end="27.630">得</span><span begin="27.630" end="28.397">有</span><span begin="28.606" end="29.072">点</span><span begin="29.072" end="30.240">怕</span></p><p begin="30.966" end="35.735" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.966" end="31.478">爱</span><span begin="31.652" end="32.033">跟</span><span begin="32.033" end="33.290">生活</span><span begin="33.290" end="33.953">的</span><span begin="34.452" end="34.802">一</span><span begin="34.802" end="35.735">切</span></p><p begin="36.214" end="42.186" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.214" end="36.899">你以</span><span begin="36.899" end="37.576">为</span><span begin="37.657" end="38.574">我</span><span begin="38.574" end="39.436">知道</span><span begin="39.642" end="40.359">怎么</span><span begin="40.359" end="41.237">拆</span><span begin="41.237" end="42.186">开</span></p><p begin="43.568" end="48.852" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.568" end="44.062">我们</span><span begin="44.062" end="44.791">的想</span><span begin="44.791" end="45.909">法和落</span><span begin="45.909" end="48.852">差</span></p></div><div begin="51.134" end="1:12.427" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="51.134" end="55.769" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.134" end="51.721">我的</span><span begin="51.721" end="52.513">爱</span> <span begin="52.769" end="53.702">是说停</span><span begin="53.702" end="54.486">不能</span><span begin="54.486" end="55.769">停</span></p><p begin="56.517" end="1:00.968" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.517" end="57.051">已经</span><span begin="57.051" end="57.736">浓得</span><span begin="57.736" end="58.403">不能</span><span begin="58.403" end="58.922">说</span><span begin="59.051" end="59.384">是</span><span begin="59.384" end="1:00.019">曾</span><span begin="1:00.019" end="1:00.968">经</span></p><p begin="1:01.861" end="1:07.474" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.861" end="1:02.429">也可</span><span begin="1:02.429" end="1:03.096">说成</span><span begin="1:03.096" end="1:03.712">我是</span><span begin="1:03.712" end="1:04.693">错的</span> <span begin="1:04.836" end="1:05.786">爱未曾</span><span begin="1:05.786" end="1:06.452">变成</span><span begin="1:06.452" end="1:07.474">真的</span></p><p begin="1:07.867" end="1:12.427" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.867" end="1:09.121">也没谈到</span><span begin="1:09.121" end="1:09.702">多</span><span begin="1:09.772" end="1:10.204">少</span><span begin="1:10.204" end="1:10.921">你</span><span begin="1:10.921" end="1:11.905">需要的</span><span begin="1:11.905" end="1:12.427">爱</span></p></div><div begin="1:12.682" end="1:39.073" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:12.682" end="1:17.153" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.682" end="1:13.436">我不</span><span begin="1:13.436" end="1:14.215">再</span><span begin="1:14.383" end="1:15.348">去执着</span><span begin="1:15.348" end="1:16.066">我是</span><span begin="1:16.066" end="1:17.153">谁</span></p><p begin="1:18.134" end="1:22.813" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.134" end="1:18.766">或是</span><span begin="1:18.766" end="1:19.417">我在</span><span begin="1:19.417" end="1:20.118">夜里</span><span begin="1:20.118" end="1:20.649">掉</span><span begin="1:20.766" end="1:21.134">的</span><span begin="1:21.134" end="1:21.785">眼</span><span begin="1:21.785" end="1:22.813">泪</span></p><p begin="1:23.485" end="1:29.058" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.485" end="1:24.105">也可</span><span begin="1:24.105" end="1:24.802">说我</span><span begin="1:24.802" end="1:25.520">看不</span><span begin="1:25.520" end="1:26.381">开的</span> <span begin="1:26.753" end="1:27.478">